From a3ac1bfb66456ee8f5152e600b6604e485f88a01 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: pgs666 <74764545+pgs666@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 11:39:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Input: touchscreen: sync complete EGoTouchRev HX83121A driver
 e738049

Import the complete production HX83121A source set from the clean
EGoTouchRev-Linux baseline-porting branch, including the split algorithm,
SafeBaseline, BLReset, panel-profile, diagnostics, and dormant stylus source.
The stylus source is retained for completeness but remains excluded from the
production object list, matching the source driver's own Makefile.

Source revision: e738049
Branch: codex/baseline-porting

